    "details": {
      "alignment": "Chaotic Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "giant",
        "subtype": "ogre"
      },
      "cr": 4,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet — Manor Gate-Breaker Ogre.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>manor-gatebreaker-ogre</code>): Large giant (ogre), Chaotic Neutral; CR 4 (proficiency +2, to hit +7 with STR); AC 14 (bolted iron scrap plate), hit points 76 (8d10+32), speed 35 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Auxiliary brutes leased from Midlands mercenary camps. Chained to the main gates and courtyard barriers to demolish obstacles and terrify approaching partisans.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> heavy siege brute · <strong>tier:</strong> Siege Auxiliary · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Heavy Beasts &amp; Auxiliaries.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/regal-lion/manor-gatebreaker-ogre.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 610012, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A massive, hulking 10-foot-tall ogre auxiliary outfitted in crude bolted iron plate armor and thick iron chains. Gripping a massive spiked tree-trunk war club with two hands, roaring aggressively. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
